# uvLottery (spec §17). Every artifact in these areas is hash-committed: the dump,
# the ticket list, the parser snapshot, the verifier snapshot, seal.json. Git must
# never rewrite a byte of them — a checkout that converts line endings turns an
# honest draw into a MISMATCH for anyone verifying on Windows.
#
# `-text` means "no conversion in either direction", not "treat as broken".
# Scope is deliberately the whole area, code included: what gets hashed and what
# does not should not depend on remembering to list it here.
uvl/**       -text
uvl-test/**  -text
